Hint: The algorithm implemented by both the PDP-11 and VAX versions prints
smiley faces repeatedly, scrolling across the screen. It prints 5 characters,
followed by four backspaces, making the next smiley face be printed over the
previous, one character over.

for (;;) {
	write(1, "  :-)\b\b\b\b", 9);
	delay();
}
